  "description": "We've partnered with UK-based illustrator and animator Mark Ward on this Limited Edition Rivette, the first in our artist series. Fascinated by California culture and raised on a healthy diet of BMX and Saturday morning cartoons, Mark's vibrant work engages the viewer with his playful humor and surreal sun-kissed visuals. The Rivette's carbon fiber frame and fork is the perfect canvas to showcase Mark's art and this bike is built out to the fullest with SRAM Red AXS components, an integrated BLKTEC R8 bar/stem combo (with computer mount) and a ZIPP 404 Firecrest Carbon wheel set. These bikes are literal works of art and super limited--don't sleep or they'll be gone.",
